flowchart LR
  U[User and MetaMask] --> WEB[Cloudflare Pages\nReact and Vite]
  WEB --> EDGE[Cloudflare Worker\nrequest_id and security]
  EDGE --> APIGW[AWS API Gateway]
  APIGW --> API[Next.js Transaction API\nLambda]
  API --> DB[Shared PostgreSQL\nagent_market schema and pgvector]
  API --> OUTBOX[Transactional Outbox]
  OUTBOX --> RELAY[Outbox Relay Lambda]
  RELAY --> SNS[SNS Domain Events]
  SNS --> MATCHQ[SQS Match Queue]
  SNS --> LEARNQ[SQS Learning Queue]
  SNS --> OPSQ[SQS Ops Queue]
  MATCHQ --> MATCH[Go Matching Lambda]
  MATCH --> DB
  MATCHQ --> DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]
  LEARNQ --> TRAIN[One-shot ECS Fargate\nCTR Training]
  TRAIN --> DB
  API --> RPC[Sepolia RPC]
  RPC --> CHAIN[YD, Escrow, Vault, Arbitration]
  CHAIN --> API
